{"id":"n83309-2-7","stage":4,"title":"다발 · 束","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83309-2-7-1","ko":"너 어제 프로포즈를 받았다며?","zh":"你昨天不是收到求婚了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"프로포즈를","meaning":"求婚","explanation":"프로포즈：求婚；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"프로포즈","audio":"/audio/59476bcbabcbfb1e725d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:프로포즈:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"프로포즈","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"받았다며?","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"59476bcbabcbfb1e","term":"프로포즈","zh":"求婚","audio":"/audio/59476bcbabcbfb1e725d.mp3","definition":"向对方提出结婚请求；规范外来语写法为 프러포즈。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d6a8e832d04603605619.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83309-2-7-2","ko":"응, 남자 친구가 장미 한 다발과 편지를 줬는데 정말 감동이었어.","zh":"对呀，男朋友送了我一束玫瑰和一封信，真的让我非常感动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，